==Strategy==
Wafer Cat BIG can make this stage frustrating, but spam works well enough to counter it. Similarly, [[:Category:Cats with Slow Immunity|Slow-Immune]] and [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|Knockback-Immune Cats]] really help here. The Jackie Pengs are not a threat and can be easily dealt with, even with the Wafer Cats.

